Description: UniWRT (21.02 port) - network-controller style theme.
 Port of uniwrt-luci 2.0.38 (ox1d3x3, Apache-2.0) to OpenWrt 21.02 Lua templates:
 icon rail, live status chips, light/dark/auto. Registers luci.themes.UniWRT21;
 it does not change the active theme.
